{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/866164-random-thoughts","id":866164,"title":"Random Thoughts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-15T16:34:08-07:00","id":866164,"title":"Random Thoughts","content":"Please tell me all your random thoughts. <br /> <br /> I'm having a random thought. <br /> <br /> is plagiarism is it still plagiarism if you took an idea from another universe?<br /> For example lets say you found your way to another universe and it had an awesome book there that no one in your universe wrote. Would it still be plagiarism bringing it to your universe and publishing it under your name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T04:47:42-07:00","id":866342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/866164-random-thoughts#post866164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please tell me all your random thoughts.<br /> <br /> I'm having a random thought.<br /> <br /> is plagiarism is it still plagiarism if you took an idea from another universe?<br /> For example lets say you found your way to another universe and it had an awesome book there that no one in your universe wrote. Would it still be plagiarism bringing it to your universe and publishing it under your name.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean another universe, as in alien civilizations and/or parallel worlds? As a neoplatonist, I think all similar ideas come from the same forms they are meant to represent and bring into this world, so I could justify your use of that book's main premise (but not a word to word copy).<br /> <br /> My random thought is just how much more f---ed up the world will become if Clinton or Trump win the presidency. I already feel part of a lost generation that keeps on losing, I'm not sure we can afford 4 more years of establishment or bigoted politics. I really hope America ends up on the right side of history and gets Bernie into the White House. :-/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T07:39:40-07:00","id":866382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>stylanski</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/866164-random-thoughts?p=866342#post866342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My random thought is just how much more f---ed up the world will become if Clinton or Trump win the presidency. I already feel part of a lost generation that keeps on losing, I'm not sure we can afford 4 more years of establishment or bigoted politics. I really hope America ends up on the right side of history and gets Bernie into the White House. :-/</div> </div> </div> </div>I would disagree on the Clinton part. The president isn't the end-all, be-all of power in the US, they're really rather constrained.<br /> <br /> Clinton is largely the &quot;more of the same please&quot; candidate in my opinion. A very conservative choice in this election, who will continue the grand traditions of flipping her stated beliefs in whatever direction the wind of public opinion blows. Money will continue to flow into politics and well, not a lot of changes. Internationally I suspect the US relations with the middle east will continue to weaken, and there might end up being another war the US gets involved in.<br /> <br /> Sanders I can see going one of two ways. Either he tries to use his power to make a difference, in which case he'll have some slight progress and be out of office after the first term. Or else he'll be conservative in his first term, likely pinning the lack of significant progress on the congress and senate, and then try to make changes in the second term. I would expect that he'd strive to keep the US out of wars and possibly dial back the ones (including the metaphysical ones) that the US is involved in now. Internationally he would likely continue the trend of a slight warming of US relations.<br /> <br /> Trump... I have no bloody idea. It's not that the man flip-flops on his opinions (most politicians do this) it's that he does so apparently completely at random. You have NO idea what he'd do as president. The casual racism, sexism, and highly stupid stuff that comes out of his mouth (amazingly JUST in time on a regular schedule to boost his ratings and polls) could, in theory, be endurable, but again you don't know how closely he holds those beliefs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}